# User Datasets & Temporary Data (Exclude raw/user datasets, permit versioned sample data in data/)
*.csv
*.tsv
*.parquet
*.feather
*.h5
*.hdf5
*.pkl
*.pickle
*.joblib

# Explicitly track versioned sample/demo datasets in data/
!data/
!data/**/*.csv
!data/**/*.tsv
!data/**/*.json
!data/**/*.md
